Description: Slate desktop: theme, wallpapers, boot splash and branding
 Everything that makes a Debian + KDE Plasma system look and feel like Slate:
 the Slate global themes (dark and light), color schemes, round icon theme,
 wallpapers, Plymouth boot splash, login screen look, GRUB defaults, default
 apps and the Slate os-release. Also adds the Slate update server, so new
 Slate versions arrive with normal system updates.

